    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "build something new? how? everyone already knows what i am. they've already decided who i am and what i'm worth. there is no \"new\" version of me, just this hollow thing left over. it feels more like i'm just waiting for the world to catch up to the fact that i'm already gone. it just feels so much more logical to just... stop fighting the inevitable.",
